    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n17173" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀρᾰπ-ός</span></b> , 
			Ep.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀταρπός</span></b> , as always in <i><span class="en">
			Hom.
		</span></i>, e.g. <i><span class="en">
			Il.
			17.743
		</span></i>, ἡ:—<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>short cut,</i> or generally, <i>path,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				7.215
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Nu.</u>
				76
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				4.36
			</span></i>, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀεὶ μίαν ἀ. πάντες
				βαδίζουσι [μύρμηκες</span>] <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				622b25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> metaph.,
				<i>walk of life,</i>
			
