					Emp.
					24
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱστορίης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>IG</u>
					3.716
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. μύρμηκος,</span>
			
